    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading collection status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "These signals check **recent log arrival**, not user activity or end-to-end health. A query failure remains an error, not a healthy state.\n\nVS Code Copilot uses metrics; inspect its source dashboard. GitHub Copilot pull-job freshness and failures belong in **Copilot reports & seats**. Collector infrastructure diagnostics remain in the existing Collectors dashboards."
